Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.40,0:00:07.17,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,0)}The radiance of the night shines through my window
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.17,0:00:11.12,Opening,,0,0,0,,but the path to immortality is long.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.60,0:00:15.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.85,0:00:21.01,Opening,,0,0,0,,Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.28,0:00:25.00,Opening,,0,0,0,,Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.40,0:00:28.25,Opening,,0,0,0,,I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.25,0:00:33.52,Opening,,0,0,0,,The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.72,0:00:37.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.84,0:00:40.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,as the storm rages just below.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.88,0:00:44.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.85,0:00:47.84,Opening,,0,0,0,,I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.00,0:00:50.69,Opening,,0,0,0,,why the world is a-changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.71,0:00:54.04,Opening,,0,0,0,,Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.28,0:00:57.21,Opening,,0,0,0,,Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.21,0:01:00.29,Opening,,0,0,0,,experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.45,0:01:03.17,Opening,,0,0,0,,I will defy the light in the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.17,0:01:06.61,Opening,,0,0,0,,to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.69,0:01:19.05,Opening,,0,0,0,,Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.21,0:01:22.13,Opening,,0,0,0,,Transform your insignificant body into light.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.29,0:01:25.25,Opening,,0,0,0,,The hardships of the journey
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.37,0:01:28.21,Opening,,0,0,0,,will temper this young man's heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.21,0:01:32.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.60,0:01:43.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,690)\fad(1000,1000)}Renegade Immortal\NSubtitles by Bonobosubs\Nhttps://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.84,0:02:05.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.32,0:02:16.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,What's on your mind ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.64,0:02:21.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,A grade 6 pill is unheard of in a rank 3 country,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.32,0:02:25.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,not to mention a Return to Origin pill.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.56,0:02:29.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid even Senior Ouyang Zi
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.24,0:02:31.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,won't be able to make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.84,0:02:34.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wan'er,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.20,0:02:36.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,in the whole Cloud Sky Sect,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.08,0:02:39.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,the person that is most likely to reach Soul Formation
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.36,0:02:41.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,is Ouyang Zi.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.08,0:02:43.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,He's obsessed with the Dao of alchemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.68,0:02:46.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,That obsession to understand the heavens
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.68,0:02:48.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,will lead him to Soul Formation in the future...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.96,0:02:50.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm sure of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.76,0:02:51.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Don't worry,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.16,0:02:54.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ouyang Zi will definitely make the pill.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.28,0:03:00.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wrong...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.12,0:03:01.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wrong !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.24,0:03:07.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's wrong...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.12,0:03:09.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Even that is wrong...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.32,0:03:11.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ancestor.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.72,0:03:12.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's wrong !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.72,0:03:22.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's all wrong !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.12,0:03:24.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Peak grade 5...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.16,0:03:26.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's not enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.64,0:03:28.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,If it takes too long to make the pill,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.84,0:03:31.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wan'er's body might not hold on for long enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.60,0:03:33.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,Don't disturb me
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.12,0:03:34.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,unless it's absolutely necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.36,0:03:39.16,Second,,0,0,0,,Is it this one ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.56,0:03:41.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you need anything else,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.44,0:03:41.24,Second,,0,0,0,,Or this one ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.32,0:03:42.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,you know where to find me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.72,0:03:43.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's wrong !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.96,0:03:51.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wan'er is reaching the end of her lifespan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.16,0:03:52.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,She's been relying on pills for years
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.16,0:03:56.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,so reaching Nascent Soul is the only way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.36,0:03:59.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,But it's against the law of the heavens...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.24,0:04:02.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's incompatible...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.56,0:04:06.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,The law of the heavens
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.12,0:04:08.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,is not invisible.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.12,0:04:11.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,It exists somewhere between heaven and earth
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.08,0:04:12.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,and interferes with our world.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.60,0:04:17.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Dragon restriction !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.08,0:04:32.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,When Wan'er reaches Nascent Soul,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.20,0:04:34.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,if it really comes for her with a tribulation,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.56,0:04:36.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,this restriction will hold it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.04,0:04:40.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,300)\pos(970,456)}3 years later
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.80,0:04:49.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,With the Ancestor's restrictions,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.40,0:04:53.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,this valley has become the most impregnable place in Chu.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.84,0:04:58.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,But what is the Ancestor guarding us against ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.44,0:05:15.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.40,0:05:19.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,You said that the Celestial Realm was shattered countless years ago
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.44,0:05:20.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,but that it's still magnificent.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.28,0:05:24.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Can I see it ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.32,0:05:28.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,We'll travel on the star compass
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.76,0:05:31.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,so you can see mountains, rivers, pavilions and palaces
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.56,0:05:33.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,of the Celestial Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.76,0:05:35.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Maybe
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.80,0:05:39.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,there are still remnants of Celestial Beasts to be found.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.48,0:05:40.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.52,0:05:43.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'd like to go to the Four Sect Alliance
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.80,0:05:46.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,to see the mortal's capital
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.36,0:05:48.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,and also
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.32,0:05:51.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,that old street you lived in.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.28,0:05:53.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.36,0:06:12.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wan'er
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.40,0:06:15.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,When you're better,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.28,0:06:17.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,come back to Zhao with me,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.76,0:06:19.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,to the Wang Family Village.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.80,0:06:21.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,What do you think ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.40,0:07:05.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,The law of the heavens is unpredictable.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.08,0:07:09.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,I don't know if it can manifest in other ways than a tribulation.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.36,0:07:21.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wan'er !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.24,0:07:39.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Life and Death Domain can no longer suppress the death aura !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.04,0:07:44.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,A Grade 6 pill !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.24,0:07:46.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,I, Ouyang Zi, completed it !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.28,0:07:50.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Return to Origin pill is extremely potent,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.12,0:07:52.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,enough for it to be harmful to her body.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.48,0:07:54.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,It should be able suppress the death aura enough
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.64,0:07:56.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,for it to be expelled.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.56,0:07:58.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,When Wan'er reaches Nascent Soul,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.28,0:08:00.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will use the strength of the Life and Death Domain,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.04,0:08:01.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,plus the power of the pagoda.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.84,0:08:05.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm sure it will give her enough time to form her Nascent Soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.64,0:08:15.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's working.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.20,0:08:54.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Condense !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.12,0:09:00.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's coming...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.80,0:09:23.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,This tribulation is really strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.00,0:09:26.40,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1582,458)\fad(300,000)}Li Muwan's\NNascent Soul
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.40,0:09:43.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Break !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.04,0:09:50.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,These dozens of restrictions I placed over the past 3 years
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.96,0:09:54.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,were barely able to block a single attack from the tribulation...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.72,0:09:56.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,The power of the law of the heavens
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.64,0:09:57.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,is terrifying.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.08,0:10:09.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,I did it !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.76,0:10:16.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.76,0:10:19.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,the death aura ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.68,0:10:20.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Impossible...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.36,0:10:22.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wan'er reached Nascent Soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.60,0:10:24.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Her lifespan should've extended.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.52,0:10:26.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Why is there so much death aura ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.24,0:10:39.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,The law of the heavens...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.64,0:10:42.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,came in person...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.84,0:10:45.76,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,000)\pos(1597,446)}Hand of the law of the heavens
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.04,0:10:58.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wan'er !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.40,0:11:03.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.08,0:11:07.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm willing to give up everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.36,0:11:11.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Even if all my past lives are destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.52,0:11:14.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,But this is
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.60,0:11:18.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,the karma between us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.28,0:11:21.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the choice of the heavens.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.88,0:11:23.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,We...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.12,0:11:29.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,After all, we are like ink and water
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.16,0:11:33.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,struggling under the heavens.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.64,0:11:36.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.48,0:11:40.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,even if time goes by,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.80,0:11:44.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,the law of the heavens won't allow
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.92,0:11:46.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wan'er to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.28,0:11:49.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since you're here...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.76,0:11:53.09,Second,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.20,0:11:53.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,I have no regrets...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.36,0:12:00.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.12,0:12:02.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,NOOOO !!!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.60,0:12:10.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wan'er !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.44,0:12:20.56,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}To let go of the consequences of my actions
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.56,0:12:22.16,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}is to ignore the law of cause and effect
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.16,0:12:24.40,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}like scattered ink.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.28,0:12:31.88,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}As destiny falls
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.12,0:12:31.88,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}in exchange for this moment of tainted dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.88,0:12:39.48,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}It makes the mountains lose their colors,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.12,0:12:39.48,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}wither and melt into rivers.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.92,0:12:47.04,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Who can deceive
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.12,0:12:43.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,So what if it's the law of the heavens ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.96,0:12:46.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will fight back !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.68,0:12:47.04,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}the law of the heavens ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.36,0:12:50.36,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Countless generations
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.64,0:12:50.36,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}have tried before me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.65,0:12:54.08,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}But how could I not catch my dreams
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.04,0:12:54.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Even if the heavens want you to die,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.28,0:12:56.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will steal you back !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.48,0:12:54.08,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}within my warm fingers ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.64,0:12:57.76,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}You're at my side when I'm alone
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.76,0:13:01.00,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}giving me the strength to fight the will of the heavens.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.24,0:13:05.44,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Fortunately, my mind was open and honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.80,0:13:09.64,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I'm sorry we never got to see the fireworks
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.64,0:13:09.64,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}in the streets.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.80,0:13:14.60,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Can I break the vortex of our destiny ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.36,0:13:14.60,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Can I break the rules ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.61,0:13:17.32,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}To run towards you !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.44,0:13:16.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Original body !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.36,0:13:20.64,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I will fight the law of the heavens and the law of cause and effect
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.64,0:13:25.28,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}to cut down this tribulation with my own hands
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.28,0:13:28.68,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}and break through the reincarnation cycle.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.72,0:13:33.36,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}All of that for the stars in your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.81,0:13:39.04,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I wish to bend this dream for the fire in my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.16,0:13:42.96,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}If your soul is willing to wander,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.96,0:13:47.60,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}can I still take your hands
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.64,0:13:47.60,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}and hold them tight ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.76,0:13:50.68,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I will defy the heavens and prevent the stars from falling.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.68,0:13:55.40,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I will overthrow the Immortals and the Demons in my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.52,0:13:58.84,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I dream of destroying
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.72,0:13:58.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wan'er's body dissipated
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.24,0:14:01.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,but her Nascent Soul has been formed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.00,0:14:03.56,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}the shackles of our fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.56,0:14:07.52,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}You're the only one that can ignore the law of cause and effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.52,0:14:10.32,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}You're the hardest to let go of.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.40,0:14:14.20,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I want to be with you again
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.28,0:14:17.56,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}so I can look in your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.84,0:14:22.80,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Even for a moment, it's worth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.56,0:14:26.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.88,0:14:36.16,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}What can be done against the law of the heavens ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.24,0:14:40.68,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}It dares to use a tribulation against your body
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.68,0:14:43.96,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}to make you enter the cycle of reincarnation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.44,0:14:46.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you want to exercise the law of the heavens
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.12,0:14:48.64,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I cultivate to break free from worldly delusions.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.68,0:14:49.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,you will have to kill me first !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.64,0:14:52.64,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I only understand when I'm regretful.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.64,0:14:55.44,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}What's the point of not letting go ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.44,0:14:59.32,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I wish I could turn around and just look away
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.32,0:15:02.68,Music,,0,0,0,, {\fad(300,300}from your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.76,0:15:03.80,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1604,446)\fad(300,000}Fist of the law of the heavens
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.96,0:15:07.84,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,900}But they're worth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.24,0:15:17.36,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1625,426)\fad(300,300}Apricot Village
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.60,0:15:21.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm the only one that can see
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.16,0:15:23.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,this battle with law of the heavens.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.80,0:15:39.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wan'er...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.56,0:16:49.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Look !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.20,0:16:50.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,What's that ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.20,0:17:02.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with the Sun today ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.16,0:17:03.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Oh my God,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.00,0:17:05.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Moon is out too !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.00,0:17:05.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,What's going on ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.88,0:17:07.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,What's happening ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.16,0:17:11.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Sun and Moon are shining together ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.72,0:17:30.20,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1557,562)\fad(300,300)}Wang Lin\Nmerged bodies\NSoul Formation\Nand 2-stars Ancient God
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.20,0:18:14.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,You want to destroy Wan'er's Nascent Soul
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.12,0:18:15.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,and erase her existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.16,0:18:18.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,I, Wang Lin, won't let you !
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.40,0:19:06.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,I did it !
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.08,0:19:13.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.52,0:19:16.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,she has been reincarnated with her Nascent Soul
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.59,0:19:18.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,so her lifespan has been extended.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.04,0:19:20.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,This falls in line with the law of the heavens.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.24,0:19:22.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,19 years from now
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.20,0:19:25.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,when her Nascent Soul reforms,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.40,0:19:27.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,I know you will come back !
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.48,0:19:29.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,But next time,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.56,0:19:31.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will stop you again !
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.96,0:19:42.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,Is this the punishment for defying the heavens ?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.24,0:19:46.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will cultivate the Life and Death reincarnation cycle.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.24,0:19:48.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,And one day,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.96,0:19:50.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will take your place !
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.88,0:19:52.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,At that time,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.12,0:19:55.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will remake the law of the heavens
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.48,0:19:57.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,to do as I, Wang Lin, wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.28,0:19:59.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will make you
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.36,0:20:01.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,kneel before me !
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.06,0:22:37.49,Note,,0,0,0,,{\pos(12,507)\fad(700,300}Here's an emotional passage of the novel that couldn't be fully adapted:\N\NLi Muwan’s eyes showed a deep sense of reluctance. She looked at Wang Lin with a nostalgic gaze and then looked around before slowly closing her eyes. A teardrop fell from the corner of her eye.\NThe teardrop slowly fell down, creating a weak sound when it landed on the ground.\NThis sound entered Wang Lin’s ears. It made him feel like the past was collapsing…\NNo one knew if where that tear fell will create a field of memories and sorrow by next year…\NThe moment she closed her eyes, her Golden Core immediately dimmed and then shattered soon after. A small person who looked exactly like the Li Muwan of the past appeared. Her eyes were pure, but they quickly closed due to Li Muwan’s death.\NWang Lin, I’m willing to give up everything. Even if the stars fall, as long as you are willing to accompany me, your heart is the brightest light.\NWang Lin, I’m willing to give up everything. Even if all my past lives are destroyed, it won’t extinguish my reluctance to leave you.\NWang Lin, I’m willing to give up everything. Even if my life ends, even if time passes on, I hope the flower of memories never wilts.\NWang Lin, this is the karma between us. This is the choice of the heavens. After all, we are like ink and water struggling under the heavens.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.24,0:05:33.28,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Don't wait for the future love,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.00,0:05:39.96,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}the soul between your eyebrows is already peaceful.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.40,0:05:48.30,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Ask the palm lines of time...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.21,0:05:55.36,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Sincerely entrust your love, don't waste time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.92,0:05:59.28,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I promised in my dreams
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.28,0:06:03.08,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}that from now on no one will block our path.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.12,0:06:09.44,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}In the blink of an eye, I will change the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.56,0:06:13.84,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}These nights of longing in the past...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.96,0:06:17.52,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Deep in my heart,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.73,0:06:19.56,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I believed that you and I
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.56,0:06:23.64,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}can cross the line between life and death.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.60,0:06:28.72,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}We will overcome our doomed fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.80,0:06:32.08,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}The night won't last forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.20,0:06:34.08,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Do you believe in
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.08,0:06:38.52,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}the unbreakable reincarnation cycle ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.40,0:06:49.52,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}After seeing your beautiful face
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.60,0:06:52.88,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}on our first meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.96,0:06:54.88,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I believe
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.88,0:06:59.32,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}fate cannot destroy our vows.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.45,0:20:24.13,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}Falling from the night sky and melting into dust\Nlike water without a source.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.20,0:20:30.29,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}Like the difference between clouds and mud,\Nthe truth cannot be found in conflict.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.40,0:20:34.23,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}Life and death\Nare like the moment when the rain falls
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.26,0:20:38.16,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}and like many other unseparable things.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.52,0:20:44.17,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}In this lifetime,\Nto cultivate the truth, cultivate the world first.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.35,0:20:51.18,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}Old grudges had to be settled\Nbecause half an inch is engraved into my tree rings.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.49,0:20:57.03,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}Use the most vivid love and hate\Nto ask questions to your fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.49,0:21:01.71,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}Let your eyes be filled enough with rage\Nto pierce the heart and the soul
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.97,0:21:05.20,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}then soften because of the mortals' fireworks.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.37,0:21:11.19,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}Only when you bend down can you understand\Nthe hidden edge of the blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.71,0:21:15.39,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}The human mind is nature,\Nthe rain fell silently like an answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.49,0:21:19.31,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}Life and death are just moments away,\Nthere are many other solutions to grudges.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.49,0:21:25.16,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}Use your dusty heart\Nto depict the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.42,0:21:29.09,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500}One stroke is for killing.\NAfter struggling for hundreds of years, I endured letting go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.30,0:21:32.87,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500}One stroke is for caring.\NEverywhere there is life, there are thousands of lights.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.99,0:21:38.91,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}Give up your mind to be refined\Nby this endless world.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.98,0:21:42.99,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}The human mind is nature,\Nthe rain fell silently like an answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.02,0:21:46.81,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}Life and death are just moments away,\Nthere are many other solutions to grudges.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.40,0:21:52.64,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}Use your dusty heart\Nto depict the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.71,0:21:56.59,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500}One stroke is for killing.\NAfter struggling for hundreds of years, I endured letting go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.63,0:22:00.43,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500}One stroke is for caring.\NEverywhere there is life, there are thousands of lights.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.73,0:22:06.29,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}Give up your mind to be refined\Nby this endless world.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.93,0:22:13.15,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}Snow falls as my hair turns white, winter withers\Nwhile prosperity sprouts in summer.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.45,0:22:19.95,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}I step into the world, with light at my fingertips,\Nthe law of cause and effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.97,0:22:26.67,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}I observe the vastness of heaven and earth so I can get rid of evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.84,0:22:33.54,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}Obsession arises from one thought, life and death arise from one thought.\NReincarnation is not to be feared.
